    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 82f132ca5d573637ee2d4cf30525a22afcdf3e15 -->\n**Verdict: Needs rework.** The door works: the status strip shows the Debug info only when developer mode is on and the pipeline reports work. This head does not pass the review.\n\nThe lane built this head: trial merge of 82f132ca5 with origin/main fac6c8e8d, clean, no CRLF changes.\n\nGate: camcraft-ui, six binaries, 200 tests, green (structural 51, ui_panel 28, ui_app 28, ui_menu 46, ui_tree 28, ui_command 19). camcraft-app lib: 13072 tests green. Clippy: green. The UI did not run in a window; the tests drive the real app headless.\n\nIndependence: this head contains a commit co-authored by mkinney, and his marker is not an independent review of it. This review is the independent one.\n\nBlockers:\n1. No test fails on the old code. A fix test must fail before the fix and pass after it.\n2. The fold and close paths have no coverage. This PR deleted the two tests that covered them. It added no replacement test. See crates/ui/tests/fold_and_highlight.rs.\n3. One test passes on every run. It does not check a value.\n\nFix: restore the fold and close coverage with tests that check values, and add one test that fails on the old code.\n\nNon-blocking: the head now conflicts with the newer main. The author must merge main and push (refresh at merge time).\n",
